# Vercel deployment ignore rules.
# Only `web/` (static build) and `backend/` (Express API) are deployed as
# services. Everything else is private source, model data or local tooling and
# is not uploaded to a deployment.

# Retired / unrelated applications
Login-and-dashboard/**
Waiting page/**
chatbot/**
child_process/**
disease prediction/**
ap.py.py

# Private model service and its datasets (deployed separately, if at all)
Algo/**

# Tests, local tooling and build output
tests/**
screenshots/**
.runtime/**
.freebuff/**
.pytest_cache/**
dist/**
web/dist/**
*.log

# Secrets: local env files are never uploaded, examples stay for documentation
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
!.env.example
!.env.example.*
